{"ticker":"AMCR","updated":"2026-10-30T22:33:45Z","profile":{"longName":"Amcor plc","shortName":"Amcor plc","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Packaging & Containers","country":"Switzerland","website":"https://www.amcor.com","fullTimeEmployees":75000,"marketCap":21891606528,"trailingPE":19.911764,"forwardPE":10.951148,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.93131995,"pegRatio":1.06,"targetMeanPrice":50.07182,"targetHighPrice":60.0,"targetLowPrice":42.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":11,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.259,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.19951999,"operatingMargins":0.09691,"profitMargins":0.04705,"totalRevenue":23505999872,"beta":0.576,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":50.94,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":36.25,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":5.52},"summary":"Amcor plc, together with its subsidiaries, develops and produces packaging solutions for nutrition, health, beauty, and wellness categories in Europe, North America, Latin America, and the Asia Pacific. Its products include apparel, applicators, bags and bulk bags, bottles and vials, building materials, canisters and jerrycans, drinking cups, films and laminates, jars, lids, tapes and adhesives, trays, tubes, wipes packaging solutions, and miscellaneous and accessories, as well as tubs and pots. The company's Global Flexible Packaging Solutions segment develops and supplies flexible packaging; and supplies polymer resin, aluminum, and fiber based flexible packaging solutions. Its Global Rigid Packaging Solutions segment manufactures rigid packaging containers, closures, dispensing and pharma delivery devices, and related products. The company sells its products through its direct sales force. Amcor plc was incorporated in 1926 and is headquartered in Zurich, Switzerland.","summary_zh":"Amcor plc 及其子公司為歐洲、北美、拉丁美洲和亞太地區的營養、健康、美容和健康類別開發和生產包裝解決方案。其產品包括服裝、塗抹器、袋子和散裝袋、瓶子和小瓶、建築材料、罐子和塑膠桶、飲水杯、薄膜和層壓材料、罐子、蓋子、膠帶和黏合劑、托盤、管子、濕紙巾包裝解決方案以及雜項和配件，以及浴缸和盆。該公司的全球軟包裝解決方案部門開發並供應軟包裝；並提供基於聚合物樹脂、鋁和纖維的軟包裝解決方案。其全球剛性包裝解決方案部門生產剛性包裝容器、封閉件、分配和藥物輸送設備以及相關產品。該公司透過其直銷隊伍銷售其產品。 Amcor plc 成立於 1926 年，總部位於瑞士蘇黎世。","sector_zh":"週期性消費","industry_zh":"包裝與容器","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":42.85,"h":43.0,"l":41.95,"c":42.1,"v":4743600},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":41.9,"h":42.0,"l":41.55,"c":41.75,"v":4117660},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":41.7,"h":41.85,"l":41.35,"c":41.75,"v":4510060},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":41.3,"h":41.7,"l":41.15,"c":41.5,"v":4055320},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":41.4,"h":41.5,"l":40.8,"c":41.1,"v":4091100},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":41.6,"h":41.65,"l":40.8,"c":40.95,"v":3444380},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":40.9,"h":41.4,"l":40.8,"c":41.15,"v":3586340},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":41.05,"h":41.8,"l":41.05,"c":41.65,"v":5086660},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":41.5,"h":41.8,"l":41.35,"c":41.4,"v":2588600},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":41.6,"h":41.75,"l":40.95,"c":41.4,"v":4854800},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":41.5,"h":42.05,"l":41.35,"c":41.95,"v":4960420},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":41.9,"h":42.4,"l":41.25,"c":41.4,"v":4350120},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":41.5,"h":41.95,"l":41.35,"c":41.55,"v":3467280},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":41.5,"h":41.75,"l":41.15,"c":41.3,"v":9587020},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":41.55,"h":41.6,"l":41.1,"c":41.25,"v":4716220},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":41.3,"h":41.4,"l":40.35,"c":40.45,"v":6164100},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":40.35,"h":40.5,"l":39.85,"c":39.9,"v":5840940},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":39.8,"h":40.15,"l":39.5,"c":39.85,"v":6095440},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":39.9,"h":40.35,"l":39.8,"c":40.25,"v":3954200},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":40.4,"h":40.85,"l":40.0,"c":40.7,"v":3597000},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":40.5,"h":40.9,"l":40.5,"c":40.9,"v":4710960},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":40.8,"h":41.2,"l":40.7,"c":40.95,"v":3147660},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":40.95,"h":41.25,"l":40.75,"c":41.15,"v":3221440},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":41.0,"h":41.25,"l":40.7,"c":40.9,"v":2897980},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":40.8,"h":40.95,"l":40.3,"c":40.35,"v":2491900},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":40.4,"h":40.6,"l":39.7,"c":39.8,"v":3106080},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":39.95,"h":40.15,"l":39.8,"c":39.85,"v":